    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/iphone-duo-price-in-bangladesh-8465.png\"></strong></h2>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Apple iPhone Duo</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Unfold endless possibilities with the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/apple\">Apple</a> iPhone Duo, designed to combine tablet-level productivity with everyday smartphone portability. Its expansive foldable display gives you a vibrant canvas for effortless multitasking, immersive viewing, and creative editing on the move. Built with an advanced titanium frame, it feels incredibly solid in hand while staying pleasantly slim. Dual high-res cameras deliver pro-grade photography with stunning clarity, and a massive battery powers you through demanding days. It&rsquo;s the ultimate statement piece for power users needing peak performance everywhere.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Foldable LTPO OLED Display</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Enjoy ultra-smooth scrolling and vibrant colors across an expansive dual-screen layout that transforms daily viewing, dynamic multitasking, and mobile entertainment into a truly immersive high-end visual experience.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Ceramic Shield 2 Protection</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Innovative glass construction with anti-reflective coating and Nano Texture finish keeps your display durable while maintaining a smooth tactile feel for everyday touch interactions.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Grade 5 Titanium Frame</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Engineered with premium Grade 5 titanium for superior structural strength, this robust yet lightweight frame gives you exceptional impact resistance alongside a comfortable feel in your hand.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Reliable All-Day Battery</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Delivers dependable power throughout demanding workdays with PD3.2 fast wired charging and 25W MagSafe/Qi2 wireless charging support.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Advanced Spatial Video &amp; Audio</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Capture realistic 3D spatial videos accompanied by rich stereo audio recording, allowing you to re-experience your favorite personal memories with breathtaking depth, clarity, and life-like realism.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Apple iPhone Duo Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Large foldable screen provides an expansive space for smooth multitasking.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Slim folded design fits comfortably into pockets for easy carrying.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Dynamic refresh rate ensures fluid touch interactions during daily usage.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Under-display selfie camera keeps the view clear without annoying cutouts.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong Grade 5 titanium frame protects device during accidental everyday drops.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Fast wireless charging support keeps power routines quick and simple.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Satellite emergency features provide reliable peace of mind everywhere.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone/iphone\">iPhone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/iphone-18-pro-max\">iPhone 18 Pro Max</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>FAQ</strong></h2>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What is the expected price of the Apple iPhone Duo in Bangladesh?</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The estimated price of the Apple iPhone Duo in Bangladesh is expected to start around ৳3,40,000 to ৳4,00,000 for the base 256GB variant, with higher storage options (512GB, 1TB, and 2TB) reaching higher depending on import duties, tax structures, and dollar exchange rates upon market availability. But you can pre order your copy from Apple Gadgets with 10000 taka in advance.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Does the Apple iPhone Duo have a foldable display?</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes. The preliminary specifications mention a foldable LTPO OLED display with a separate cover display.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How much storage does the Apple iPhone Duo offer?</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The listed options range from 256GB to 2TB, with 12GB RAM across the mentioned configurations.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Does the Apple iPhone Duo support wireless charging?</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes. The provided information mentions wireless MagSafe and Qi2 charging, along with wired charging.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What cameras does the Apple iPhone Duo have?</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">It features dual 48MP rear cameras (a 48MP main sensor with 2x optical-quality telephoto mode and a 48MP ultrawide sensor). For selfies, it includes an under-display camera on the internal folding screen and a 12MP Center Stage camera on the cover display.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">What are the screen sizes of the two displays?</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">iPhone Duo has two separate screens that share the exact same aspect ratio for smooth app scaling:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Outer Display: A 5.4-inch screen used when the phone is closed. It gives you about 90% of the screen space of a standard iPhone 18 Pro.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Inner Display: Comes with a massive 7.6-inch folding screen revealed when you open the device.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Does the iPhone Duo have Face ID or Touch ID?</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">iPhone Duo only features Touch ID. Apple removed Face ID entirely on this model to make the phone as thin as possible when opened. Instead, the fingerprint sensor is built directly into the power button on the side of the device.</p>"
