    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/iPhone-17-Pro-Max-Price-in-Bangladesh-3150.jpg\"></h2>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>iPhone 17 Pro Price in Bangladesh</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Feel the power of A19 Pro and dive into productivity with <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/apple\">Apple</a>&rsquo;s latest iPhone 17 Pro. Comes with an amazing design and reliable build quality. Its cool new rear look with unique colors feels wow at first glance. Your contents come alive with its amazing display. The new processor delivers amazing processing power. Grab it from Apple Gadgets and enjoy Apple Gadgets&rsquo; exclusive offers, EMI plans, warranty support, and best price in Bangladesh.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why You&rsquo;ll Love It</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Impressive super Retina XDR OLED display offers smooth visuals and an immersive viewing experience.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Its latest operating system supports advanced features, apps, and multitasking.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Supports ultra fast wired and wireless charging with convenient reverse power sharing.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Triple-lens camera captures wide, telephoto, and ultrawide shots with precision.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Durable body design provides complete dust protection and reliable water resistance daily.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Stereo speakers deliver clear sound while advanced wireless options keep you connected.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Special Features of iPhone 17 Pro&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Advanced Photography System &ndash; Turn Every Shot into a Masterpiece</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Triple Lens Photography: You can capture every moment clearly with three 48 MP cameras. Its wide, ultrawide and telephoto lenses give you the flexibility to snap everything.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Low-Light &amp; Night Photography: Smart sensors with OIS technology keep your photos clear and vibrant while making night and low light shots sharp and full of detail.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Professional Video Recording: Record vibrant 4K videos with ProRes RAW and Dolby Vision HDR. Gyro-EIS keeps footage steady and spatial audio adds immersive sound making every video look and feel professional.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Display &amp; Design &ndash; Stunning Visuals with Rugged Elegance</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Super Retina XDR Brilliance &ndash; Experience ultra-smooth 120Hz visuals on the LTPO OLED display. With HDR10 and Dolby Vision and up to 3000 nits peak brightness every image looks sharp, vibrant and is easy to view indoors or under sunlight.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Premium Durable Design &ndash; iPhone 17 Pro has a strong Ceramic Shield 2 front with an aluminum alloy frame and a glass back that makes it stylish and tough for daily use.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Water &amp; Dust Resistant &ndash; With an IP68 rating it stays safe from dust and can handle being in water up to 6 meters deep for 30 minutes so you can use it with confidence anywhere.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Performance &amp; Processing Power- Faster, Smarter, and Ultra-Responsive</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Next-Gen iOS 26: iOS 26 makes your iPhone faster and smarter. With new features, stronger privacy, and smooth performance it helps you stay connected, work easily, and enjoy a seamless experience every day.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Massive Storage &amp; Speed &ndash; Available in 256GB, 512GB, and 1TB variants with 12GB RAM the iPhone 17 Pro ensures fast performance and enough space for all your apps, photos, videos, and files.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Blazing Fast Speed &amp; Graphics &ndash; The Hexa-core CPU paired with the 6-core Apple GPU ensures smooth performance, seamless multitasking, and stunning visuals for gaming and professional apps.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Battery &amp; Charging &ndash; All-Day Power with Lightning-Fast Recharge</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Long-Lasting Battery: Li-Ion 3998 mAh (Nano SIM) or 4252 mAh (eSIM) keeps you powered all day.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Fast Charging: Wired PD3.2 charges 50% in 20 minutes; wireless MagSafe reaches 50% in 30 minutes.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Reverse Charging: Supports 4.5W reverse wired charging to power other devices on the go.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Connectivity &amp; Extra Features &ndash; Reliable Networks with Precise Location &amp; Security</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Advanced Wireless Connectivity: Supports Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6.0, and tri-band hotspot for fast and reliable connections.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Precise Positioning: GPS, GLONASS, GALILEO, BDS, QZSS, and NavIC ensure accurate location tracking anywhere.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Secure &amp; Smart Features: Face ID, Ultra Wideband (UWB), and sensors provide security, navigation, and seamless device interaction.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Exclusive Apple Gadgets Offer</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Official Apple product with 1-year international warranty</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Exclusive offer with competitive pricing in Bangladesh</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Easy EMI up to 36 months with partnered banks</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Cash on delivery, bKash, Nagad, card payments accepted</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Fast delivery: 24&ndash;48 hrs in Dhaka, 3&ndash;5 days outside<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why Buy iPhone 17 Pro from Apple Gadgets?</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Apple Gadgets is a trusted Apple products provider in Bangladesh. That means when you buy from us (online/offline), you benefit from:</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">100% genuine products with official Apple warranty &ndash; Every iPhone comes with a verified Apple warranty, giving you peace of mind and protection against manufacturing defects.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Multiple outlets and pickup points &ndash; Convenient locations across Bangladesh let you pick up your iPhone in person or access support whenever needed.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Expert after-sales support &ndash; Our trained staff assist with device setup, troubleshooting, and advice on Apple accessories for iPhone, iPad, MacBook, and more. For repairing support we have our own concern Apple Gadgets Care.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Flexible payment and EMI facilities &ndash; Choose from flexible EMI plans, bKash, Nagad, cash-on-delivery, and card payments to make owning your iPhone 17 Pro easier and more affordable.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Reliable and quick service &ndash; Apple Gadgets ensures fast and hassle-free support for any device issues, keeping your experience smooth and worry-free.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>See Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/iphone-air\">iPhone Air</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/iphone-17-pro-max\">iPhone 17 Pro Max</a></li>\n</ul>"
