    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Motorola-Edge-70-Fusion-5G-Price-in-Bangladesh-3002.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Motorola Edge 70 Fusion 5G</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/motorola\">Motorola</a> Edge 70 Fusion 5G is a masterclass in blending sophisticated style with high-octane performance. This device feels incredibly premium in the hand, featuring a slim profile and a vibrant 144Hz AMOLED display that makes every swipe and scroll feel buttery smooth. Photography enthusiasts will love the 50MP OIS camera, which ensures your memories are captured with stunning clarity, even in shaky hands. With its massive battery and ultra-fast 68W charging, you can stay connected to what matters most all day long. It is the perfect all-rounder for anyone who demands both beauty and brawn in their pocket.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Rugged All-Day Powerhouse</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">IP68/IP69K and MIL-STD-810H build survive splashes, drops, and dust perfect for Bangladesh's unpredictable weather and daily commutes.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Non-Stop Battery Life</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">7000mAh battery lasts 72+ hours endurance, so you charge less and stay connected through long workdays or weekend trips.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Motorola Edge 70 Fusion 5G Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">High-speed 5G connectivity ensures lag-free browsing and instant downloads.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">144Hz AMOLED screen provides a fluid and immersive viewing experience.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Snapdragon processor delivers snappy performance for seamless multitasking.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">OIS-enabled camera captures steady, professional-quality photos every time.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Massive 7000mAh battery keeps you powered through the busiest days.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">68W fast charging gets you back to full power quickly.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Under-display fingerprint sensor offers secure and instant phone access.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why Choose Apple Gadgets</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Apple Gadgets is your go-to destination for authentic tech and peace of mind. We offer a seamless shopping experience with trusted after-sales support and expert guidance to help you choose the right device. With flexible EMI options and multiple payment systems, upgrading your tech becomes affordable and stress-free. Plus, our commitment to providing genuine products with full warranty assurance makes every purchase completely worry-free.<br><br></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/motorola-edge-60-pro-5g\">Motorola Edge 60 Pro 5G&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/motorola-edge-60-fusion-5g\">Motorola Edge 60 Fusion 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/motorola-edge-60-5g\">Motorola Edge 60 5G</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>"
