    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Galaxy-A37-5G-Price-in-Bangladesh-4468.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Galaxy A37 5G</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Make your productivity done faster with the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/samsung\">Samsung</a> Galaxy A37 5G smartphone. Designed for users who want a high-end experience while spending less. with a stunning 6.7-inch Super AMOLED display to enjoy contents better. Besides having greater viewing, this phone also has a slim build protected by Gorilla Glass Victus+ and an IP68 rating, ensuring it stays safe from drops, dust, and water. Inside the beast, there's an Exynos 1480 chip which handles tasks effortlessly. Above all, the combination of a high-refresh-rate screen and a massive battery makes it perfect for media consumption.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Beautiful Large Display</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">With a large screen you get a fluid 120Hz refresh rate and a peak brightness of 1900 nits, making colors pop and motion look incredibly smooth. Whether you are scrolling through social media or watching high-definition videos, the display remains perfectly clear and easy to see even under direct sunlight.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Useful Intelligent Features</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Get intelligent features to improve your productivity. Features like &ldquo;Circle to Search&rdquo; helps you easily identify objects. While &ldquo;Object Eraser&rdquo; quickly lets you remove unwanted objects from your favorite photos. There&rsquo;s also useful edit suggestions and many more filtering options.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Galaxy A37 5G Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Slim design &amp; glossy glass rear finish makes it look super sleek</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Octa-core processing power handles day to day tasks smoothly</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Durable glass construction resists scratches and heavy daily wear</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Stereo speakers provide a loud and very immersive audio experience</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Under-display fingerprint sensor offers fast and secure phone access</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Massive storage options allow you to keep thousands of photos</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Large battery supports 45W fast charging for quick power boosts<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/galaxy-a35-5g\">Galaxy A35 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/galaxy-a36-5g\">Galaxy A36 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/galaxy-a57-5g\">Galaxy A57 5G</a></li>\n</ul>"
