    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Honor-400-5G-Price-in-Bangladesh-9192.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Honor 400 5G</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/honor\">Honor </a>400 5G is crafted to impress, both inside and out. With its sleek 7.3mm thin body and lightweight feel, it offers comfortable handling and premium looks. The 6.55-inch AMOLED display delivers vibrant visuals at up to 5000 nits peak brightness, making everything from videos to browsing crystal clear, even under sunlight. It runs on the powerful Snapdragon 7 Gen 3 chipset, paired with Android 15 and MagicOS 9 for a smooth, customizable experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Capture every detail with its impressive 200MP main camera, and shoot cinematic 4K videos with ease. Whether you&rsquo;re taking wide scenic shots or ultra-clear selfies, the triple camera setup and 50MP front camera won&rsquo;t let you down. A 5300mAh battery ensures all-day use, and the 66W fast charging keeps you powered up in a very short time. From performance to design, this phone has everything you need for a flagship-level experience.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Honor 400 5G Features</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Enjoy super-smooth performance with the Snapdragon 7 Gen 3 processor.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Dive into rich visuals on the AMOLED display with 5000 nits peak brightness.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Scroll and stream seamlessly with the ultra-fluid 120Hz refresh rate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Snap ultra-detailed shots with the massive 200MP main camera.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Capture stunning selfies and 4K videos with the 50MP front camera.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hear every beat with stereo speakers and immersive audio.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Stay powered all day with a 5300mAh battery and 66W fast charging.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why Choose Apple Gadgets?</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Looking for the best place to purchase the latest gaming laptops, Apple products, or other top-quality gadgets in Bangladesh? Look no further than Apple Gadgets, the unparalleled leader in providing top-notch gadgets in the country. Enjoy the convenience of two shopping options with us &ndash; either through our seamless online platform (<a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/\">Apple Gadgets</a>) or by visiting our physical outlets in different locations. Rest assured, we have you covered for all your gadget needs including Honor 400 5G.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">See more products in the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/honor-200-5g-official\">Honor 200 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/honor-400-pro-5g\">Honor 400 Pro 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/honor-200-5g\">Honor 200 Smart 5G</a></li>\n</ul>"
