    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Galaxy-Z-Flip7-Price-in-Bangladesh-5077.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Galaxy Z Flip7</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Flip into the future with the brand new <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/samsung\">Galaxy</a> Z Flip7 where bold design meets powerful performance. This foldable phone gives you a large 6.9-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X screen that feels super smooth with its 120Hz refresh rate. When folded it turns into a compact device with a bright and useful Super AMOLED cover display.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">It runs on a strong deca-core processor and has 12GB RAM with 512GB storage so you can multitask and enjoy fast performance all day. You can also take amazing photos with the 50MP dual rear camera and record videos in crisp 4K. The 4300mAh battery gives you long hours of usage without any worry. With 5G support and Wi-Fi 7 you will stay connected wherever you go. The Galaxy Z Flip7 is perfect for those who want something stylish and powerful at the same time.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Galaxy Z Flip7 Features</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Big 6.9-inch foldable screen with smooth 120Hz and bright 2600 nits display</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Compact foldable design fits easily in pockets and feels premium when opened</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Powerful Exynos 2500 chip with 12GB RAM for smooth and fast performance</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Triple camera setup captures sharp wide and ultrawide shots with amazing detail</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Long-lasting 4300mAh battery supports fast 45W charging for all-day use</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Latest Android 16 with Wi-Fi 7 and dual eSIM keeps you connected always</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why Choose Apple Gadgets?</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Looking for original tech at the best price in Bangladesh? Apple Gadgets is your trusted place for everything from Headphones and smartwatches to smartphones and accessories&mdash;all 100% authentic and in one spot. From the latest speakers to budget-friendly phones, we make sure you get top-quality products with trusted warranty and helpful after-sales support.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We offer fast delivery, simple return policies, and friendly customer service to keep your shopping easy and worry-free. You can visit our outlets in person or order online from anywhere in Bangladesh.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Thousands of happy customers already rely on <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/\">Apple Gadgets</a> for their daily tech needs, and now you can too by buying the Galaxy Z Flip7. Visit the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category and explore the latest releases.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/galaxy-z-flip7-fe\">Galaxy Z Flip7 FE</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/galaxy-z-fold7\">Galaxy Z Fold7</a></li>\n</ul>"
