    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Honor-X9D-5G-Price-in-Bangladesh-5887.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Honor X9D 5G</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/honor\">Honor</a> X9D is a rugged and no-nonsense flagship for extreme seekers. It's 6.79&rdquo; 120Hz AMOLED floods color with insane brightness, while the latest strong CPU &amp; GPU runs the most demanding apps smoothly. Shoot ultra detailed 4K video on the 108MP IOS imaging system, then go for days on the 8300 mAh Si/C battery with 66W rapid charging. With IP69 and SGS triple resistance, X9D shrugs anything from scouching Sahara heats to deep dives. Stereo speakers and adaptive AptX seals the deal for unending creativity and adventures.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Industry's First SGS Triple-resistant Phone</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">SGS certified, IP68, IP69K and 2.5m drop resistance keep the X9D safe in rain, jets, dust or accidental falls everywhere.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Battery That Refuses to Quit</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">8300mAh Si C battery powers multi day use, 66W rapid recharge restores hours fast and supports 7.5W reverse charging convenience.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Audio &amp; Video that Turn the Heads</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">6.79-inch 120Hz AMOLED with 6000 nit peak, 108MP OIS and aptX Adaptive audio &ndash; you have your full creative suit in one small package for on-the-move editing &amp; recording.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Honor X9D 5G Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">SGS triple certification ensures X9D barely feels hard falls, rain or dust storms</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">One tap dust &amp; water ejection features makes it the perfect choice for extreme users</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Industry leading chipset with Hono&rsquo;s custom UI gives fluid, enjoyable navigation</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Hi quality audio - video capture and output features offer a full creative suit in your palm</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Advanced wireless protocols &amp; NFC raises the smartphone experience to a new height<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Buy Honor X9D 5G from Apple Gadgets: Largest Honor Shop BD</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Looking for the Honor X9D 5G? <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/\">Apple Gadgets</a> makes it easy with genuine stock, extensive warranty and clear pricing that removes guesswork. As the leading destination for genuine Honor gadgets &amp; gears in Bangladesh, we bring the widest range of tech products from Mobile Phones and Tablets to Smart Watches and Power Accessories. Compare, pick and pair with confidence!&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">We deliver your favorite tech with speed and care bundled with convenient solutions like in-store pick and flexible payments like cards, bKash, Nagad and easy EMI to fit your budget and busy schedule. So if you&rsquo;re hunting for the best deal on Honor X9D 5G, this is the exact place to be.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Explore more from <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phones</a> &amp; stay updated on the latest arrivals at Apple Gadgets.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/honor-400-pro-5g\">Honor 400 Pro 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/honor-x9c-5g-official\">Honor X9C 5G - Official</a></li>\n</ul>"
