    "descriptionHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://adminapi.applegadgetsbd.com/storage/media/large/Redmi-Turbo-5-Max-Price-in-Bangladesh-4247.jpg\"></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Redmi Turbo 5 Max</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The Redmi Turbo 5 Max is powered by the advanced Dimensity 9500s chipset built on a 3nm process. This device delivers exceptional speed for gaming, multitasking, and heavy applications. Besides, there&rsquo;s also its massive 6.83-inch AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and up to 3500 nits peak brightness ensures vivid visuals even in bright outdoor conditions. With an enormous 9000 mAh battery and 100W fast charging, the phone is designed for users who demand extreme battery life without sacrificing performance or premium features.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Next-Generation Performance with Dimensity 9500s</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Powerful MediaTek Dimensity 9500s processor built on cutting-edge 3nm architecture offers flagship-level speed and efficiency. Combined with up to 16GB RAM and ultra-fast UFS 4.1 storage, the phone handles intensive gaming, multitasking, and heavy apps effortlessly.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Ultra-Bright AMOLED Display with Dolby Vision</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">AMOLED display supports 120Hz refresh rate, Dolby Vision, HDR10+, and HDR Vivid. With up to 3500 nits peak brightness, the screen stays clear and vibrant even under direct sunlight while delivering smooth animations and immersive visuals.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Extreme Battery Capacity with 100W Fast Charging</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Huge 9000 mAh silicon-carbon battery delivers exceptional endurance for gaming, streaming, and daily tasks. With 100W fast charging and reverse charging support, the device quickly powers up and can even charge other devices when needed.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Premium Durability with IP68 and IP69K Protection</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Features a glass and aluminum build with advanced IP68 and IP69K water and dust resistance. This ensures durability against splashes, dust, and even high-pressure water jets in demanding environments.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Redmi Turbo 5 Max Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Dimensity 9500s flagship chipset delivers ultra-fast performance for gaming and heavy multitasking</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Large AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate ensures smooth scrolling and immersive visuals</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">3500 nits peak brightness keeps the display visible even in strong sunlight</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">50MP main camera with OIS captures sharp photos and stable 4K videos</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Massive 9000 mAh battery supports extremely long usage for gaming and streaming</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">100W fast charging quickly refuels the battery for minimal downtime</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">IP68 and IP69K protection improves durability against dust and water<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/redmi-turbo-5\">Redmi Turbo 5</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/poco-f8-ultra\">Poco F8 Ultra 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/poco-f7-5g\">Poco F7 5G</a></li>\n</ul>"
