    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Redmi Turbo 4 Pro 5G - CN</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/xiaomi\">Xiaomi</a> Redmi Turbo 4 Pro 5G - CN is a high-performance mid-range device with modern technology for modern users. It comes with Snapdragon 8s Gen 4, which is a 4 nm chipset that delivers extreme performance while gaming and multitasking. This device provides a massive battery of about 7550 mAh along with a 90W Wired fast charger. It also has a user-friendly interface built on Hyper OS. A big AMOLED display of about 6.83 inches with 120 Hz refresh rate and up to 3200 nits peak brightness ensures vivid and bright colour even in outdoor conditions.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Powerful Chipset Snapdragon 8s Gen 4</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Turbo 4 Pro 5G comes with a powerful Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 chipset that ensures smooth performance. Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 is a 4 nm chipset with Adreno 825 GPU, which offers a balance between high-end performance and cost-efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Massive Battery Backup&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The device comes with 7550 mAh battery, which provides very long battery life for gaming, streaming, and heavy usage. This allows the phone to charge quickly and with a 22.5W reverse wired charge other devices.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>AMOLED Display&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The phone features a 6.83-inch AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and Dolby Vision. This makes the display extremely smooth, vibrant, and clearly visible even under bright sunlight.&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Redmi Turbo 4 Pro 5G - CN Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 (4 nm) ensures smooth performance&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">6.83-inch AMOLED display with 120 Hz refresh rate that provides high-quality and sharp visuals&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Massive 7550 mAH battery provides very long battery life while gaming, streaming, or multitasking.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">IP68 dust-tight and water-resistant ensures durability against dust, splashes, and water exposure.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">90W fast charging allows the phone to charge quickly and can even charge other devices.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">50 MP main camera is optimized for stable video and detailed photos.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">UFS 4.1 storage fasten your important works&nbsp;<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Why Choose Apple Gadgets?</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Upgrade your daily life with smart technology and purchase your daily life accessories, gadgets, and mobiles from Apple Gagets. We provide Authentic, premium, and genuine products. Enjoy the convenience of two shopping options with us, either through our seamless online platform (Apple Gadgets) or by visiting our physical outlets in different locations<br><br></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone\">Mobile Phone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/redmi-turbo-5\">Redmi Turbo 5</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/redmi-note-15-pro-plus-5g\">Redmi Note 15 Pro Plus 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/poco-x7-pro-5g\">Poco X7 Pro 5G</a></li>\n</ul>"
