    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Nokia 220 4G</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Enjoy simple, reliable communication with the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/nokia\">Nokia</a> 220 4G. This stylish button phone is designed for comfortable handy use and long-lasting use. Crafted with a comfortable hand-feel and available in three gorgeous colors, it combines functional design with vibrant looks. The phone features a large display for clear text viewing, a high-capacity battery providing hours of continuous talk time, and a built-in torch light for instant illumination whenever you need it.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Extended Talk Time</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Powered by a large battery that provides hours of continuous talk time, ensuring uninterrupted conversations without the need for frequent charging.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Nokia 220 4G Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Available in three attractive color choices to suit your style.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Large display offers easy reading of messages and menu navigation.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">High-capacity battery delivers extended hours of talk time.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Comfortable, ergonomic hand design fits securely in your palm.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Built-in bright torch light provides quick and practical illumination.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/nokia-108\">Nokia 108</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/nokia-130-ds\">Nokia 130 DS</a></li>\n</ul>"
