    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Oppo A6s Pro - Official</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Introducing the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/oppo\">Oppo</a> A6s Pro - Official, a device that can take your camera experience to the next level. By featuring a 50 MP camera, this device captures stunning pictures without losing details. Take incredible selfies with the 50 MP ultra wide selfie camera that can cover up to 100&deg; field of view. The large AMOLED display can deliver vivid and fluid content and visual experience with refresh rate of up to 120Hz. Above all, this phone is backed up by a large battery that can be refueled by a powerful SUPERVOOC charger within a short time.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Power in Every Task</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Inside this device is a MediaTek Helio G100 MAX SoC that can handle all your regular tasks with ease. Enjoy comfortable gaming with decent graphics quality by utilizing this powerhouse.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Stunning Shot Everytime</strong></h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This phone features 50 MP sensors in both front and back, capturing high quality pictures with vivid colors and sharp details. It can cover up to 100&deg; field of view in selfies, not missing anyone out of the frame.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Oppo A6s Pro - Official Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Includes a big battery for long device usage.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Supports SUPERVOOC charging to recharge the battery quickly.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">The AMOLED screen features 120Hz refresh rate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">The large display provides FHD+ resolution with a high refresh rate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Powerful selfie camera with a wide FOV covers a large area.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Fast storage solution makes the device usage buttery smooth</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Features a powerful eight core processor system to handle heavy duties.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Explore more of the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone/oppo\">Oppo phones</a> here.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Products</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/oppo-a6-official\">Oppo A6 - Official</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/oppo-k14\">Oppo K14 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/oppo-reno13-pro\">Oppo Reno13 Pro 5G</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/oppo-a5-pro\">Oppo A5 Pro - Official</a></li>\n</ul>"
