    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><br><strong>ViVO X300 Ultra</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Experience peak mobile performance and professional-grade photography with the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/vivo\">ViVO</a> X300 Ultra smartphone. Encased in a durable glass and aluminum body with comprehensive dust and water resistance, it features an ultra-smooth LTPO AMOLED display that renders vibrant colors, deep contrast, and fluid motion for immersive viewing. Powered by a top-tier flagship processor paired with high-speed memory and storage, it executes heavy gaming, high-resolution video editing, and complex multitasking effortlessly. Besides, the advanced camera setup incorporates professional optical lenses, periscope telephoto zoom, and gimbal stabilization lets users capture studio-quality photos and cinema-grade video in any lighting.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Top-Tier Flagship Processor</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ultra-fast 3nm octa-core processor lets you play spectacular games effortlessly with high FPS. Run multiple apps without worries while not worrying too much about performance issues.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Gimbal-Stabilized Optics</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Professional gimbal-stabilized camera array, high-speed UFS storage, and ultra-fast charging for uncompromised power, imaging precision, and endurance.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>ViVO X300 Ultra Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Buttery smooth viewing from high refresh rate supported LTPO AMOLED display.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Powered by Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5 processor to deliver superior performance.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Triple camera setup with gimbal optical image stabilization, periscope telephoto zoom, and Zeiss optics.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Excellent video recording capability with 10-bit Log and Dolby Vision HDR support.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">High-capacity battery with 100W wired and 40W wireless fast charging.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">IP68/IP69 dust-tight and water-resistant aluminum frame construction.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone/vivo\">ViVO smartphone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/redmi-pad-se\">Redmi Pad SE</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/redmi-pad-2\">Redmi Pad 2</a></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/vivo-y02a-official\">VIVO Y02A - Official</a></li>\n</ul>"
