    "descriptionHtml": "<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong><br>Nokia 123 Shield</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Built for everyday reliability, the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/nokia\">Nokia</a> 123 Shield Feature Phone combines durable protection with essential communication features in a compact design. Its IP65-rated body resists dust and low-pressure water, making it suitable for work and outdoor use. The 2.4-inch TFT display offers clear visibility, while the 1750mAh removable battery provides dependable all-day power. With Dual SIM support, USB Type-C charging, wireless FM radio, MP3 playback, and expandable microSD storage, it delivers everything you need for simple, dependable mobile connectivity without unnecessary complexity.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Rugged Everyday Protection</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The IP65-rated body offers reliable resistance against dust and low-pressure water, making the phone suitable for demanding daily environments and outdoor use.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\">Long-Lasting Essential Performance</h3>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A removable 1750mAh battery, Dual SIM functionality, USB Type-C charging, and wireless FM radio provide dependable communication and entertainment throughout the day.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Nokia 123 Shield Key Highlights</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IP65 protection resists dust and low-pressure water exposure.</li>\n<li>1750mAh removable battery delivers reliable everyday backup power.</li>\n<li>Dual SIM support keeps personal and work numbers together.</li>\n<li>USB Type-C charging offers convenient modern cable compatibility.</li>\n<li>Wireless FM radio provides entertainment without wired headphones.</li>\n<li>Compact 2.4-inch TFT display ensures comfortable daily usability.<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">View more from the <a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/category/mobile-phone/nokia\">Nokia Mobile Phone</a> category.<br><br></p>\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Check Similar Product Price</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/nokia-110-power-official\">Nokia 110 Power - Official</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/product/nokia-150\">Nokia 150 DS 2023 - Official</a></li>\n</ul>"
